Third-party licenses: transit-macro-osc
=======================================

The DSP in this crate is a Rust port of Emilie Gillet's MIT-licensed firmware (the macro oscillator
in the eurorack repository, with the stmlib helpers it uses). The port is Oliver Rockstedt's
mi-plaits-dsp-rs, vendored at commit effe9864bb67d23aaf5724722ac1ce165d4e7c9f and then corrected
by transit against the C++ oracle (crates/macro-osc-oracle). Provenance and every local change are
in VENDOR.md. transit's own changes are MIT OR Apache-2.0, like the rest of transit; the vendored
code stays under the MIT notices below, all three of which apply to it.


